      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>To the dear brother R. Zekharya may his R(ock) p(reserve him),</li>\n<li>informing him of my great longing for him and informing him</li>\n<li>that he should not delay the old woman from traveling</li>\n<li>to us, because we are perishing from isolation.</li>\n<li>The girl is sick and we have no one</li>\n<li>to fill a cup of water for us. Please,</li>\n<li>help her come.</li>\n</ol>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
